From: Xun2202 <98207886+Xun2202@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 13:42:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] downloads: report byte progress and avoid repeated HLS media
 probing

Keep queue progress observable at zero percent, merge native and machine reports without duplicate byte counts, parse VOD duration from a bounded manifest request, and retain sparse first-data/stall diagnostics. Key active video jobs by stable episode ids instead of mutable Download hashes. Video-only Anikku path; Mihon pages are outside its data-class key and Animeko uses an independent engine.
